flowchart TD
 Q["Query + explicit history"] --> P["Query plan / typed policy"]
 P --> H["Harness: Belief / Progress / Budget"]
 H --> R["Dense + lexical + visual retrieval"]
 R --> F["Fusion + rerank"]
 F --> V["LLM verify / coverage"]
 V -->|missing| H
 H --> B["Targeted document / table / figure bridge"]
 B --> V
 V -->|complete| C["Pack verified evidence"]
 C --> G["Generator + citation contract"]
 G --> T["Private trace + offline evaluation"]
 E["Immutable evidence-v1 + provenance"] --> R
 E --> B
 T -. "offline only" .-> L["SFT / RL / harness evolution"]
 L -. "versioned frozen policy" .-> P
